                <pb facs="0756" n="662" sameAs="frus:frus1896/pg662"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Rockhill to Mr.
                            Delgado, United States vice-consul in
                        charge.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1896-09-11"><hi rendition="#italic">September 11,
                        1896</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Reported to Department Oscar Cespedes, confined in Matanzas castle, is American
                    citizen. Investigate and report by cable.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Rockhill.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
